{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "副本模板定义 - 副本入口配置，关联地图/敌人组/队列时长/奖励包。基于副本系统设计定稿 §4。",
    "designDoc": ".trae/workspace/design/dungeon/副本系统-版本设计定稿.md#4",
    "consumers": ["dungeonController", "rewardTimes.service", "battleQueueService", "battle.service.finishBattle"],
    "notes": [
      "dungeonId 为副本唯一标识，前端详情页据此请求 /api/dungeon/:id",
      "enemyGroupId 引用 enemy-groups.json 的 groupId",
      "rewardPackId 引用 rewardTables.json 的 reward_id（字符串形式），作为通关奖励包",
      "dungeonType 仅表示副本类型（normal 普通 / rare 稀有），用于判定胜利时消耗存档级奖励次数池中的对应类型（v1.4.0：废弃每副本独立 dailyAttempts，统一接入 Save.rewardTimes 存档级共享池）",
      "副本挑战次数不限制；胜利时普通副本消耗 1 点普通奖励次数、稀有副本消耗 1 点稀有奖励次数，次数为 0 时不扣且无最终奖励",
      "queueDuration 单位为秒，统一战斗队列据此倒计时",
      "mapId 为字符串标识，关联地图场景（Map.mapId 为 number，此处用语义化字符串占位）",
      "difficulty 为难度分级字符串（'1'/'2'/'3'），对应前端显示难度Ⅰ/Ⅱ/Ⅲ"
    ]
  },
  "templates": [
    {
      "dungeonId": "dn_trial_normal",
      "mapId": "map_trial_arena",
      "difficulty": "1",
      "dungeonType": "normal",
      "enemyGroupId": "eg_training_basic",
      "queueDuration": 6,
      "rewardPackId": "30001",
      "order": 1,
      "_consumers": {
        "dungeonId": ["dungeonController.getDetail", "dungeonController.start", "rewardTimes.service"],
        "mapId": ["dungeonController.getDetail", "ui.dungeon"],
        "difficulty": ["ui.dungeon"],
        "dungeonType": ["dungeonController.start", "rewardTimes.service", "ui.dungeon", "battle.service.finishBattle"],
        "enemyGroupId": ["dungeonController.getDetail", "battle.service.deployBattle", "battle.service.validateInstanceBattleStart"],
        "queueDuration": ["battleQueueService", "ui.dungeon"],
        "rewardPackId": ["dungeonController.getDetail", "loot.service", "ui.dungeon"],
        "order": ["dungeonController.list", "ui.dungeon"]
      },
      "_comment": "试炼场·普通。1只初级试炼小猪，难度Ⅰ。rewardPackId=30001（初级试炼击杀掉落表）。胜利消耗存档级普通奖励次数（共享池，上限4）"
    },
